      "createdAt": 1780814394472,
      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-lesson-log 1.0.0 – First release\n\n- Introduces a structured lesson logging assistant for independent teachers.\n- Implements a 5-dimension framework for post-lesson reflection (lesson content, mastery, reaction, progress, adjustments).\n- Enables lesson records and student learning trajectories to sync with solo-dashboard and student-analyzer.\n- Supports timely (within 5 minutes) lesson documentation, with accuracy annotations for delayed entry.\n- Automates lesson consumption tracking with a pre-deduction and adjustment window.\n- Provides connection points for lesson planning and parent communication features.",
